## Retry / Recovery 状态机

### 当前实现

```
Cell
  ↓
PresentationEngine.generateQuestions()
  ↓
Selector → RetryLoop
  ↓
Validate (BatchValidator)
  ├─ PASS → SemanticQuestion
  └─ FAIL
       ↓
   Retry same Cell (max 3)
       ↓
   exhausted
       ↓
   shortfall → POL recovery
```

### 状态机合规性

| 检查项 | 是否合规 |
|--------|----------|
| Generator 失败不偷换 KP | ✅ |
| Generator 失败不偷换 type | ✅ |
| Generator 失败不偷换 difficulty | ✅ |
| Validator 失败不改 plan | ✅ |
| Recovery 由 POL 决定 | ✅ |

